/*
 * Declares the ClassFieldAccessValue class.
 *
 * ClassFieldAccessValue represents a field access on a class instance. This
 * operator applies only to real class objects—instances of an actual class
 * type—not to ClassPtrType values that merely wrap a struct. Struct field
 * accesses are handled by StructFieldAccessValue instead.
 *
 * This operator extracts a named field from the object and always produces an
 * lvalue, since class fields are assignable when the instance itself is
 * mutable.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::generator::value::operator::fields::class_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/generator/value/operator/fields/class_.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-03-02
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
